Audit date: 28 September 2026. Execution receipts retain their actual UTC timestamps. `MANIFEST_SHA256.json` covers delivery files other than itself. It provides integrity against that manifest, not external cryptographic authentication of the research. This audit does not silently modify the author manuscripts or replace any shared Library artifact.
